  "title": "CSCH evaluates RN53(RN64(1/SINH(x))), flushing subnormal quotients to 0 and returning #DIV/0! at 0",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0 build 20430, CSCH(x) returns #DIV/0! at x = 0, takes the stored x87 reciprocal RN53(RN64(1 / SINH(x))) over the SINH kernel, and flushes subnormal outputs (including |x| above ln(DBL_MAX) where SINH(x) overflows to infinity) to +0. Of 33,306 full-bank CSCH rows, 33,305 match and 1 differs by 1 ULP.",
